text:
Voice AI calls just got a privacy upgrade. 🔒

@DeepgramAI now runs fully on-prem with encrypted audio and model weights, powered by @fortanix  Confidential AI and NVIDIA Confidential Computing.

Read the press release: https://t.co/h4yqRdFpMr

📣 Useful AI has arrived — and NAVER is building the infrastructure to meet it at scale.

@official_naver will expand its GAK Sejong data center using the NVIDIA DSX platform, starting at 55 megawatts with plans to reach gigawatt scale, powering sovereign and physical AI models, agents and enterprise workloads across Korea and beyond.

🔗 Learn more: https://t.co/ZdfyDIuJT0
